:: Asylum Depths Intro
<<effects>>

A decrepit corridor sits at the intersection of the cells, living areas, and treatment centre. It's blocked off with a chain, and a "NO ENTRY" sign. Wallpaper flakes off the sides, and the far end is shrouded. You make out other rooms leading away, and a staircase at the far end.
<br><br>

<<npc Harper>><<person1>>
"That part of the facility is unused," says a voice. It's Harper. "There used to be more patients here. Please stay away. It's not kept in order, and is unsafe."
<br><br>

An orderly arrives, and delivers a message via a look. Harper smiles at you, and departs.
<br><br>

<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Asylum]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths
<<asylumeffects>><<effects>>

You stand in the ominous corridor. Through doors you see rooms, their contents coated with dust and grime. Other doors lead to hallways, branching off from the corridor. You'll need to be careful, lest you get lost.
<br><br>

<<if $asylumstate is "sleep">>
	It's bed time back in the inhabited part of the asylum. You return before your absence is noticed.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Asylum]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $asylumstate is "exercise" and $daily.asylumExercise isnot 1>>
	It's time for exercise back in the inhabited part of the asylum. You return before your absence is noticed.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Asylum]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $asylumstate is "firsttreatment" and $daily.asylumTreatment1 isnot 1>>
	It's time for your treatment back in the inhabited part of the asylum. You return before your absence is noticed.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Asylum]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $asylumstate is "secondtreatment" and $daily.asylumTreatment2 isnot 1>>
	It's time for your treatment back in the inhabited part of the asylum. You return before your absence is noticed.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Asylum]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $asylumstate is "assessment" and $daily.asylumAssessment isnot 1>>
	It's time for your assessment back in the inhabited part of the asylum. You return before your absence is noticed.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Asylum]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<if $asylum_mirror is undefined or $asylum_office is undefined or $asylum_garden is undefined>>
