:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Willpower
<<effects>>

You remember you're not on stage at all, but stood in front of an array of mirrors.
<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	Strange as they may be, you're in the asylum, and it could be dangerous to forget. Just like that, <span class="green">you're back in the mirror room,</span> but the scene still plays out in front of you, the audience awaiting.
	<br><br>

	But there's something else. Behind the audience, between them, like seams on a doll. Another presence watches you. You feel like you're reaching for it, and its unseen form. In a flash, alien emotions flood your mind. A sympathetic curiosity, then panic.
	<br><br>

	You black out.
	<br><br>
	
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	They're special mirrors, though. <span class="red">You find yourself drawn back in,</span> and your feet begin to tap.<<gwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Dance
<<effects>>

Music begins, and lights change as you begin to dance, plunging the audience into darkness. You can see only your stage, and a dimly lit orchestra to the side. You still feel the audience's enraptured eyes on you, drinking your every move. The thrill of it sends a shiver down your spine, energising your limbs, overcoming the creeping fatique.<<lllawareness>><<llltrauma>><<awareness -18>><<trauma -18>>
<br><br>

You dance harder, faster. Until exhaustion catches up with you, and you collapse.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 3
<<effects>>


<<npc Harper>><<person1>>
You awaken on your bed, in your cell. Doctor Harper stands over you, a concerned frown on <<his>> face.
<br><br>

"I'm glad you're well," <<he>> says. "We found you in the forbidden section, surrounded by mirrors. How do you feel?"
<br><br>

<<link [[Say you're fine|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Fine]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Tell <<him>> <<he>> must take you to your audience at once|Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Audience]]>><<awareness -6>><<trauma -6>><</link>><<lawareness>><<ltrauma>>
