:: Asylum Depths Mirror 4 Fine
<<effects>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I'm well," you say. "Sorry for concerning you."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I'm fine," you say. "Mind your own business."
<<else>>
	"I'm okay," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

Harper smiles at your words, but <<his>> brow remains concerned. "As you say. I'll leave you to your peace. Be well." <<He>> leaves your cell, closing the door behind <<him>>.
