	<<link [[Leave|Asylum Depths Tunnel 4 Leave]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You make it some way, but the light ahead seems to shimmer and fade. <span class="red">You feel disoriented,</span> and turn back the way you came. You gulp in the air. <<swimmingskilluse>>
	<br><br>
	
	You climb onto the shore, dry yourself, dress, and enter the asylum.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Asylum Depths]]>><<dry>><<clotheson>><</link>>
